{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誡勿輕淨土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四十八願"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九品觀章"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文殊、普賢、天親、龍樹等，或別譯願文，或著在經論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且從晉世東林淨社劉、雷等十八賢，洎百二十三人同誓，遺民屬詞。\n其後冠蓋之士，德望之僧，潔志之俗，富於編簡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、疑師，二、疑法，三、疑自。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、禮懺門，二、十念門，三、繫緣門，四、眾福門。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "造通二種，一理具，十界依正，一念頓足。二變起，全理緣起，知無\n不為。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由三無差，方感應道交，悲願相攝。共變各變，因果方成。若但一理無差，不曉諸法互具，未\n善圓旨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直指凡心。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六凡法界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四聖法界也。攝義亦二，一理具，二事造，並攝十\n界。十界之內，身土淨薉，何法不在。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摩訶衍，大乘也。若非此心，\n安堪乘運。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世人縱云淨土出大乘，不能如上約教甄簡，甯逃混濫，未足決疑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "存心徧禮十方三世一切佛法僧寶，拜起，\n兩膝著地，手執香爐，燒眾名香云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "冥心少頃，徧運香雲，供養三寶，普熏眾生，咸生淨土。\n想已置爐，起作一禮。禮已合掌，曲躬懇切，想面對彌陀及一切佛，而讚歎曰："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讚願已，即便禮佛，一一存心專對云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "靈峰大師注云：此禮舊本無，今依幽溪大師添入，使三寶具足。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮已，即兩膝跪地，執手爐燒香，至誠而倡是言："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "起禮，復跪，執手爐云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應三說，若時促及事迫，一說亦得起云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次旋遶法，或三帀，或七帀，乃至多帀，如是稱念，隨意隨帀，不拘遍數，稱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次至別座，誦彌陀經，或觀經。若不誦得經，一心稱名，量時而止，更迴向結撮亦得。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作已便止，不必拜。要盡此生，不得一日暫廢。唯將不廢，自要其\n心得生彼國。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譬佛念眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譬眾生念佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於持戒四眾，勿行汙染。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嚴禁漁捕，及誡姦鬬。六齋日者，白月初八，四王使者巡世。十四，四王太子巡。十五，四王親\n巡。黑月二十三、二十九、三十，巡世準上。若四王親下，諸天星宿鬼神，俱時隨從。遇修福齋戒者，諸天相慶，\n即注祿添算，護持福業，令其成就。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成時云：世有此一輩，以持名壓捺妄想，不\n知求生，故為極力道破。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因緣釋，約教釋，本迹釋，觀心釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指本迹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指觀心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音異"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2128_p0690a07"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T47n1969Ap0199c18"}
{"id": null, "n": "0577001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0577001", "type": "orig", "text": "（便宜上，表題ヲ附ス。󴦒）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0584001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0584001", "type": "orig", "text": "矩疑短"}
{"id": null, "n": "0596001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0596001", "type": "orig", "text": "上疑土"}
